*ch3_wait_longer_bad
[cm]
[wait time=500]

...[p]

[wait time=500]

Five minutes later—[p]

“Ayaka.”[p]

The manager's voice came from the back room.[p]

“That customer over there... He's been hanging around without buying anything for a while now.”[p]

“Could you go check on him?”[p]

[chara_hide_all time=300]
[wait time=500]

Ayaka sighed softly and began walking toward him.[p]

Should he run—?[p]

By the time the thought occurred to him, it was already too late.[p]

[auto_chara name="綾香" face="convenience_angry"]
“...You.”[p]

Ayaka's eyes fixed squarely on Takumi.[p]

“You're Nagayama, aren't you? What are you doing?”[p]

[chara_hide_all time=300]
[wait time=500]
[auto_chara name="拓海" face="convenience"]
Takumi couldn't answer.[p]

He had been too cautious.[p]

In a small convenience store in a residential neighborhood, a customer who wandered around inside for too long[r]
_ was suspicious for that reason alone.[p]

He could never use the same method again.[p]
[chara_hide_all time=300]

[bg storage="black.png" time=1000]
That night, his phone vibrated.[p]

A brief message from Ryuya appeared on the screen.[p]

“Come to the rooftop tomorrow.”[p]

The instant Takumi read that one sentence,[r]
_ he knew it was all over.[p]

