*ch3_megumi_play_dumb_bad
[cm]
[auto_chara name="拓海" face="level2_normal"]
“...What do you mean?”[p]

Takumi answered, doing his best to appear calm.[p]

“I never went to any convenience store.”[p]

[auto_chara name="恵" face="sad"]
Megumi lowered her eyes slightly and gave a small nod.[p]

“...I see.”[p]

[chara_hide_all time=300]
She didn't ask him anything else.[p]

Only a heavy silence remained in the room.[p]

Eventually, Megumi quietly stood.[p]

[auto_chara name="恵" face="sad"]
“Sorry. That was a strange thing to ask.”[p]

[chara_hide_all time=300]
Leaving him with those words, she walked out of the room.[p]

Takumi couldn't stop her. All he could do was watch her go.[p]

[bg storage="black.png" time=1000]

That day.[p]

He had lied to the one person who had tried to understand him.[p]

As a result, he never joined forces with Megumi, and he couldn't stop Takada.[p]

Ryuya's violence never ended either.[p]

And every day stayed exactly the same.[p]

